  "claim_scope": "For each fixed (depth,count), the existing configured Shared.frames chain starts from the signed dynamicFeed and uses the original source programme. Its same-root occurrence query supplies the source-coordinate decoder through the actual paid old+effect result. The actual frame.action determines paid mathNext inheritance versus settled nextBorn action/update. Both complete inventories are dynamically merged at birth and every already-registered event is retained at all subsequent actual stages, with real Some witnesses. The highest direct consumer uses the original actual_next, successor_valid, birth/whole/old-outcome, no_refill and same-debt wellFounded mechanisms.",
  "certified_machine_facts": [
    "The two frozen production modules, NativeContinuation direct gate, independent same-query/trace and branch-inventory controls, and full provenance gate all pass fresh trust0/warningAsError.",
    "The 740 actual local imports equal the fixed HEAD plus frozen CP72/CP73/CP74 sources. All shared 738 source/import/artifact closures match the now-formal CP73 certificate; none were recompiled by this certifier.",
    "sourceRaw pairs the current normalized-epoch raw environment with active-raw and lifts the original paid A/E/B programme. Actual old+effect evaluation supplies the first result coordinate; born_source_action is recognized afterward.",
    "Independent rfl controls identify sourceResult with actual resultFace.rootRead, including its full query trace. The existing component=None source root is inherited, rather than replaced.",
    "actual_branch matches the original frame.action. Paid advances only to original mathNext and retains epoch/rootHEq/both inventory Options. Settled uses original nextBorn to apply the decoded action to false and retain every true coordinate, while reusing the original whole first-destination, target_next and all-old-outcome receipts.",
    "nextInventory combines the prior complete physical inventory with actual frame.paidRead exposure; nextPairInventory combines its prior complete inventory with that same actual query trace. SourceHistoryCommon.seed retains both complete rooted trees, trace and frontier.",
    "The four inventory insertion/retention mouths and step/frames retention mouths return real written objects with Option=some written and event membership. No getD default stands in for a write.",
    "Independent branch controls show actual settled nextBorn assigns both configured inventory fields; the actual paid branch retains their original Options and does not claim a fresh Some insertion.",
    "continuous_written_and_next applies to the actual Shared.frames dynamicFeed continuous stage, retains the initially registered programme event, and consumes the existing canonical next, successor validity, no-refill and local same-debt Noetherian relation.",
    "All 17 printed key mouths depend only on propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound. The six source/decoder/inventory/configuration declaration closures have no Shared.next/nextBorn/frames dependency and no actor.generate path after cutting the existing runtimeFacade."
  ],
